- /story, /ac: .agents/skills/ba-user-story/SKILL.md
- /usecase: .agents/skills/ba-use-case/SKILL.md
- /mockup: .agents/skills/ba-ui-mockup/SKILL.md
- /audit: .agents/skills/ba-content-audit/SKILL.md
